Node ID=9019 templar shields
Text=The Templar shield chain, acts 1 to 8: Lion at Squire, Holy at Warden, Aegis at Paladin. Take all three and hold them up together -- same shield three times, the lion ghosted under the cross in both upgrades. The Spirit Templar Shield and the Helm of the Templars rendered NOTHING on the character before 0.93.0, so equip each and look at yourself. Helm plus either Templar shield is +4 AC. The Aegis returns 15% of physical damage to whoever hits you: that number is calibrated, not measured, so go get hit and tell me if it feels right. To test the SCENE rather than the items: make yourself a Templar, take the Holy Shield, travel to act 7 and talk to Sir Roger. The row that matters is whether the conversation gives you control back.
